{
  "about": [
    "emote modifiers: the words that change an emote, as data. one file for every app.",
    "words: space-separated modifier words and what they add up to (sx, sy = the stretch, a minus = mirrored, at most 4;",
    "turn = quarter turns clockwise; hue = the tint in degrees or null; paint = the colour looks, in order).",
    "plain: true = not a modifier at all. lines: a line split on single spaces, the words that are emotes in the room,",
    "and want = modifier word index -> the emote word index it changes. a modifier word missing from want stays as typed",
    "(a word, or the emote of that name). a bttv-shaped word (w!, a tint, a chain led by one) takes the emote after it,",
    "an ffz-shaped one the emote before it; each falls back to the other side; text or nothing on both sides = as typed."
  ],
